# Claude Code scratch worktrees. Throwaway checkouts, not work.
.claude/

# A 157 MB copy of the raw Bhaktamar scans landed in the repo root. The deck
# ships from public/cards/ as 48 webps; these are the originals and have no
# business in git. Ignored rather than deleted — they are not ours to remove.
Bhaktambar Guidance Card/

# Scratch bundle dir for rendering components to static SVG without a browser
# (see the chart section of docs/HANDOFF.md). Regenerated on demand.
.render/

# Credential files that have landed in the repo root by accident — a Supabase
# service-role key and the Razorpay keys, both one `git add -A` away from a
# public repo that publishes to GitHub Pages. This net is a backstop, not a
# home: nothing holding a credential belongs in the working tree at all. Move
# it outside, and keep secrets in the three stores INSTRUCTIONS.md §3 names.
*key*.txt
*key*.csv
*.pem
